<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>내과 클리닉 상세 — MEDIVITA</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;400;600&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{
  --navy:#0A1628;--blue:#1A3A6B;--blue-mid:#2E5FA3;
  --sky:#EBF2FC;--gold:#B8935A;--gold-light:#D4AA72;
  --teal:#0D7377;--teal-light:#E0F5F5;
  --white:#FFFFFF;--off-white:#F8F9FC;--light:#F0F4FA;
  --border:#DDE4EF;--text:#1A1A2E;--text-mid:#4A5568;--text-light:#8896B0;
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--white);overflow-x:hidden}

/* NAV */
nav{background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(10,22,40,0.07);}
.nav-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
.nav-back{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-mid);font-weight:300;transition:color 0.2s;}
.nav-back:hover{color:var(--teal)}
.nav-back .arrow{font-size:1rem;}
.nav-logo{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:none;}
.nav-book{background:var(--gold);color:white;padding:8px 18px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;transition:background 0.2s;}
.nav-book:hover{background:#9E7B45}

/* HERO */
.clinic-hero{
  padding:60px 24px 52px;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}
.breadcrumb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.breadcrumb a{font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-decoration:none;font-weight:300;}
.breadcrumb span{font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);font-weight:300;}
.breadcrumb .current{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8)}
.clinic-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid rgba(212,170,114,0.5);color:var(--gold-light);padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:300;}
.clinic-hero h1{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.8rem);font-weight:400;color:white;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:12px;}
.clinic-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold-light)}
.clinic-hero .subtitle{font-size:0.9rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;max-width:560px;}
.hero-badge{
  position:absolute;right:60px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
  width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  font-size:3rem;
}

/* MAIN CONTENT */
.clinic-main{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;}
@media(min-width:768px){.clinic-main{grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:52px;}}

/* 본문 */
.clinic-body{}
.body-section{margin-bottom:40px;}
.body-section h2{
  font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--navy);
  margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;
  border-bottom:2px solid var(--teal);display:inline-block;
}
.body-section p{
  font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.95;color:var(--text-mid);
  font-weight:300;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.body-section p strong{font-weight:500;color:var(--text);}

/* 대상/증상 태그 */
.target-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0;}
.target-chip{
  padding:6px 14px;border-radius:4px;
  font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:400;
  background:var(--teal-light);color:var(--teal);
  border:1px solid rgba(13,115,119,0.2);
}

/* 치료/검사 리스트 */
.treatment-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:16px 0;}
@media(max-width:500px){.treatment-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.treatment-item{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;
  padding:12px 14px;background:var(--off-white);border-radius:4px;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
}
.treatment-item .t-icon{font-size:1.1rem;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
.treatment-item .t-text{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text);font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;}
.treatment-item .t-text small{display:block;font-size:0.68rem;color:var(--text-light);font-weight:300;margin-top:2px;}

/* 프로세스 */
.process-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;margin:16px 0;}
.process-step{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:14px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.process-step:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.step-num{
  width:32px;height:32px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--teal);color:white;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:500;margin-top:2px;
}
.step-body h4{font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px;}
.step-body p{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-mid);font-weight:300;line-height:1.6;}

/* 사이드바 */
.clinic-sidebar{}
.sidebar-card{
  background:var(--off-white);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px;
  position:sticky;top:76px;
}
.sidebar-card-header{
  padding:16px 20px;background:var(--navy);
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
}
.sidebar-card-header .s-icon{font-size:1.2rem;}
.sidebar-card-header h3{font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;color:white;}
.sidebar-card-header p{font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-weight:300;}
.sidebar-body{padding:20px;}
.sidebar-info-row{
  display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);align-items:flex-start;
}
.sidebar-info-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.sidebar-info-row .si-label{
  font-size:0.68rem;color:var(--text-light);font-weight:300;
  width:52px;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:2px;
}
.sidebar-info-row .si-value{font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text);font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;}

/* 예약/문의 버튼 */
.sidebar-btns{padding:0 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.btn-reserve{
  display:block;text-align:center;padding:14px;
  background:var(--teal);color:white;text-decoration:none;
  font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:4px;
  transition:background 0.2s;border:none;cursor:pointer;width:100%;
}
.btn-reserve:hover{background:#0A5E62}
.btn-inquiry{
  display:block;text-align:center;padding:13px;
  background:white;color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;
  font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:4px;
  border:1.5px solid var(--teal);transition:all 0.2s;cursor:pointer;width:100%;
}
.btn-inquiry:hover{background:var(--teal-light)}
.btn-call{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  padding:12px;background:var(--off-white);color:var(--navy);
  text-decoration:none;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:4px;
  border:1px solid var(--border);transition:all 0.2s;
}
.btn-call:hover{border-color:var(--navy)}

/* 주의사항 */
.notice-box{
  background:#FFFBF0;border:1px solid #F0D9A0;border-radius:4px;
  padding:16px 18px;margin-top:16px;
}
.notice-box h4{font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:500;color:#8B6914;margin-bottom:8px;}
.notice-box ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}
.notice-box ul li{font-size:0.75rem;color:#7A5F10;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;padding-left:14px;position:relative;}
.notice-box ul li::before{content:'·';position:absolute;left:0;}

/* 관련 클리닉 */
.related-clinics{margin-top:40px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
.related-clinics h3{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:20px;}
.related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;}
@media(min-width:768px){.related-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
.related-card{
  padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.2s;background:white;
  display:block;
}
.related-card:hover{border-color:var(--teal);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.related-card .r-icon{font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:8px;display:block;}
.related-card .r-name{font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px;}
.related-card .r-desc{font-size:0.68rem;color:var(--text-light);font-weight:300;line-height:1.4;}

/* MODAL */
.modal-overlay{
  display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);z-index:500;
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;
}
.modal-overlay.show{display:flex;}
.modal{
  background:white;border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:480px;
  overflow:hidden;animation:modalIn 0.3s ease;
}
@keyframes modalIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
.modal-header{
  padding:20px 24px;background:var(--navy);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
}
.modal-header h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:white;}
.modal-close{background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);font-size:1.4rem;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;}
.modal-body{padding:24px;}
.form-group{margin-bottom:16px;}
.form-group label{display:block;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;}
.form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{
  width:100%;padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;
  font-size:0.82rem;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;color:var(--text);
  transition:border-color 0.2s;outline:none;
}
.form-group input:focus,.form-group select:focus,.form-group textarea:focus{border-color:var(--teal);}
.form-group textarea{height:100px;resize:none;}
.form-group .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;}
.form-note{font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--text-light);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.5;}
.form-submit{
  width:100%;padding:14px;background:var(--teal);color:white;
  border:none;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:500;
  cursor:pointer;transition:background 0.2s;
}
.form-submit:hover{background:#0A5E62}

/* SUCCESS */
.success-msg{display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0;}
.success-msg .s-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:12px;}
.success-msg h4{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;}
.success-msg p{font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-mid);font-weight:300;line-height:1.6;}

/* LOADING */
#loading{
  position:fixed;inset:0;background:white;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  z-index:999;transition:opacity 0.3s;
}
.loading-logo{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--navy);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="loading"><div class="loading-logo">MEDIVITA</div></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-back"><span class="arrow">←</span> 내과 클리닉 목록</a>
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">MEDIVITA</a>
    <a href="#" class="nav-book" onclick="openModal('reserve')">진료 예약</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO (JS로 채워짐) -->
<div class="clinic-hero" id="clinicHero">
  <div class="hero-bg" id="heroBg"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">홈</a>
      <span>›</span>
      <a href="index.html#internal-section">내과</a>
      <span>›</span>
      <span class="current" id="breadcrumbCurrent"></span>
    </div>
    <span class="clinic-tag" id="clinicTag"></span>
    <h1 id="clinicTitle"></h1>
    <p class="subtitle" id="clinicSubtitle"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-badge" id="heroBadge"></div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN -->
<div class="clinic-main">
  <div class="clinic-body" id="clinicBody"></div>
  <div class="clinic-sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-card">
      <div class="sidebar-card-header">
        <span class="s-icon">📋</span>
        <div>
          <h3>진료 안내</h3>
          <p>예약 후 방문을 권장합니다</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sidebar-body">
        <div class="sidebar-info-row"><span class="si-label">진료시간</span><span class="si-value">평일 08:30 — 17:30<br>토요일 08:30 — 12:30</span></div>
        <div class="sidebar-info-row"><span class="si-label">점심시간</span><span class="si-value">12:30 — 13:30</span></div>
        <div class="sidebar-info-row"><span class="si-label">전화</span><span class="si-value">02-XXXX-XXXX</span></div>
        <div class="sidebar-info-row"><span class="si-label">위치</span><span class="si-value">강남구 청담동<br>MEDIVITA 빌딩 3층</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sidebar-btns">
        <button class="btn-reserve" onclick="openModal('reserve')">🗓 예약하기</button>
        <button class="btn-inquiry" onclick="openModal('inquiry')">💬 문의하기</button>
        <a href="tel:02-XXXX-XXXX" class="btn-call">📞 02-XXXX-XXXX</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- RELATED -->
<div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 80px;">
  <div class="related-clinics">
    <h3>다른 내과 클리닉</h3>
    <div class="related-grid" id="relatedGrid"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 예약 모달 -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="reserveModal">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3>🗓 진료 예약</h3>
      <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('reserve')">×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div id="reserveForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>클리닉</label>
          <input type="text" id="reserveClinic" readonly style="background:var(--off-white);">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div><label>성함 *</label><input type="text" placeholder="홍길동"></div>
            <div><label>연락처 *</label><input type="tel" placeholder="010-0000-0000"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div><label>희망 날짜</label><input type="date"></div>
            <div><label>희망 시간</label>
              <select>
                <option>오전 9시</option><option>오전 10시</option><option>오전 11시</option>
                <option>오후 1시</option><option>오후 2시</option><option>오후 3시</option>
                <option>오후 4시</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>증상 / 요청사항</label>
          <textarea placeholder="간단히 증상이나 요청 사항을 적어주세요."></textarea>
        </div>
        <p class="form-note">* 접수 후 담당자가 확인 전화를 드립니다. 예약 확정은 전화 확인 후 완료됩니다.</p>
        <button class="form-submit" onclick="submitForm('reserve')">예약 신청하기</button>
      </div>
      <div class="success-msg" id="reserveSuccess">
        <div class="s-icon">✅</div>
        <h4>예약 신청이 완료되었습니다!</h4>
        <p>빠른 시간 내에 담당자가 확인 전화를 드리겠습니다.<br>문의사항은 02-XXXX-XXXX로 연락 주세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 문의 모달 -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="inquiryModal">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3>💬 온라인 문의</h3>
      <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('inquiry')">×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div id="inquiryForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>문의 클리닉</label>
          <input type="text" id="inquiryClinic" readonly style="background:var(--off-white);">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div><label>성함 *</label><input type="text" placeholder="홍길동"></div>
            <div><label>연락처 *</label><input type="tel" placeholder="010-0000-0000"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>문의 유형</label>
          <select>
            <option>진료 관련 문의</option>
            <option>비용 문의</option>
            <option>검사 관련 문의</option>
            <option>기타</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>문의 내용 *</label>
          <textarea placeholder="궁금하신 내용을 자유롭게 적어주세요."></textarea>
        </div>
        <p class="form-note">* 문의 내용은 영업일 기준 1~2일 내에 답변드립니다.</p>
        <button class="form-submit" onclick="submitForm('inquiry')">문의 접수하기</button>
      </div>
      <div class="success-msg" id="inquirySuccess">
        <div class="s-icon">📨</div>
        <h4>문의가 접수되었습니다!</h4>
        <p>영업일 기준 1~2일 내로 답변 드리겠습니다.<br>긴급 문의는 02-XXXX-XXXX로 연락 주세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// ─── 클리닉 데이터 ───
const clinics = {
  rheumatoid: {
    tag: 'Specialty Center · A',
    title: '류마티스 · <em>통증 센터</em>',
    titlePlain: '류마티스·통증 센터',
    subtitle: '관절 통증부터 면역계 이상까지, 근본적인 원인을 치료합니다.',
    icon: '🦴',
    bgGradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1628 0%, #1a3a2a 60%, #0D7377 100%)',
    body: `
      <div class="body-section">
        <h2>센터 소개</h2>
